Evaluation materials

Original media, source text captures and generated corpus media are not
redistributed in this repository. Only evaluation metadata and reports are
retained. The per-source author, licence, licence URL, original source/work URL
and payload SHA-256 are recorded in:

  eval-results/holdout7/source-manifest.json
  eval-results/holdout8/source-manifest.json

Regeneration requires obtaining the recorded source representations and
observing their individual terms. Construction-lineage hashes identify the
original construction artifacts; source and payload hashes identify media bytes.

Optional DINOv2 embedding model

Model weights are not included. The explicit `eidolon fetch-models` command
downloads the pinned ONNX conversion and verifies its recorded SHA-256.

The upstream facebook/dinov2-small model card declares Apache-2.0 (checked
2026-10-30):
  https://huggingface.co/facebook/dinov2-small/blob/main/README.md
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2/blob/main/LICENSE

The pinned onnx-community conversion card identifies facebook/dinov2-small as
its base model, but does not declare a separate licence in its metadata.
Conversion-specific licence metadata/terms have not been independently verified:
  https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/dinov2-small/blob/8b1f705a3a7f6f062f6bdd21986c1583d3ef105d/README.md

Consult the upstream and conversion repositories before downloading or
redistributing model weights. This notice does not grant additional rights.
